                        2,  2,     0.0000,     0.0000,   189.6207,     0.0000,     2.5000,    74.0000,     0.0050,     0.0000,     4.3000,     0.0200,     0.0200
TrackFinderOnHits_ParThetaA: Double_t 59.4
TrackFinderOnHits_ParThetaB: Double_t -0.02
